      "value": "I’m experiencing this in the live version too. When previewing a bow accessory worn on the back, I can only see the side that faces the avatar. I can’t rotate it far enough to see the front of the bow, which is the part visible to others.\n\nA full 360° preview would make it much easier to see what an accessory looks like before buying it!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
