  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's understandable to items most likely having less details on the backside due to the performance requires, but some items do have details on its back, plus new type of items like backpacks that's literally backward, those types of shop items will be less attractive and less convenience to knowing its properties\n\n(Ps. the third picture, after checked around all sort of items, the angle became more limited for somehow. Think there's some sort of bug as well, I will open another canny but I failed to pin the issue down atm)",
